3.25.2
- Correct genomic inflation factors in lfmm2.test() for multivariate GLM
  association tests: compute one factor per environmental covariate across loci,
  rather than one per locus.
- Calibrated p-values may change substantially; rerun affected analyses.
- Raw GLM statistics, uncalibrated p-values, single-covariate behavior,
  linear tests and full tests are unchanged.

